{
  "id": "section-stealth-rolls",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Stealth rolls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,22,36]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sometime, you are given the option\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,36,71]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to act unnoticed by an opponent,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,71,104]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or to slip past a guard. This requires\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,104,143]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a Stealth save vs. the target’s L. Roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,143,183]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "at +1 if you have the Stealth Skill\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,183,219]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and at +2 if you have Stealth\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,219,249]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(Expert). If you succeed, you can\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,249,283]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "either attack that opponent at +2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,283,317]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "on your first attack (due to surprise)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,317,356]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or slip past that enemy unnoticed\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,356,390]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(you may move through the box as\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,390,423]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "if the opponent did not exist). If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,423,462]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fail, the enemy will attack and gain\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,462,499]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the initiative, acting before you, and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,499,538]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will have +1 to its L for the duration\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,538,577]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-stealth-rolls:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of the combat.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[35,577,592]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    35
  ]
}
